8
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:32,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's such a damn cutie!</b></font>

9
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 5A]
You mean knockout!</b></font>

10
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:35,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, you should talk to her!</b></font>

11
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 5B]
Uh! Nah.</b></font>

12
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not messin'
with those groupies.</b></font>

13
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:39,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Serina Kanno.</b></font>

14
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:41,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To some...</b></font>

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she plays the role of an idol</b></font>

16
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or a model.</b></font>

17
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And...</b></font>

18
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:49,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI] Oh, yeah, didn't
she and Kai used to go out?</b></font>

19
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:51,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MIRU] Really?
-[UKA]...to Miura,</b></font>

20
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:54,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-an ex-girlfriend.
-[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

21
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:57,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] They dated
in year three of junior high,</b></font>

22
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but they broke up
outta the blue,</b></font>

23
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:01,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and it's been super awkward
between them ever since.</b></font>

24
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even I don't know why!</b></font>

25
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:05,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
It's that bad?</b></font>

26
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then, that means...</b></font>

27
00:01:09,030 --> 00:01:11,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] And I so
appreciate you catching it!</b></font>

28
00:01:12,450 --> 00:01:13,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks again!</b></font>

29
00:01:13,910 --> 00:01:16,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

30
00:01:16,410 --> 00:01:18,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Even though she's amazing,</b></font>

31
00:01:18,290 --> 00:01:19,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it wasn't enough for him.</b></font>

32
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:21,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

33
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:57,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

34
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:57,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>SPARKLE 5 A
GREAT PERSON</b></font>

35
00:02:58,050 --> 00:03:00,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
All right, listen up, everyone!</b></font>

36
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:02,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The culture festival's
in two weeks.</b></font>

37
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Oh, yeah!</b></font>

38
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:06,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] About time something
fun happened around this place!</b></font>

39
00:03:06,230 --> 00:03:08,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But don't forget what the next
three days have in store!</b></font>

40
00:03:08,730 --> 00:03:10,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Midterms!</b></font>

41
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:12,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI] Finally gives us
one second of joy--</b></font>

42
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO]
Only to tear it away.</b></font>

43
00:03:13,610 --> 00:03:15,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just make sure to study,
and you won't have to worry</b></font>

44
00:03:15,950 --> 00:03:17,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about missing the festival.</b></font>

45
00:03:17,490 --> 00:03:20,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Good luck!
-Aw, midterms suck.</b></font>

46
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:21,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I hate Math.</b></font>

47
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't take notes.</b></font>

48
00:03:23,830 --> 00:03:25,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not like it would've helped ya!
[chuckles]</b></font>

49
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:27,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah?
Not like you're one to talk!</b></font>

50
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:29,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Ah? What's up?</b></font>

51
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh...I'm happy
to lend you my notes.</b></font>

52
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:34,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or, if it would help,</b></font>

53
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:36,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-we could study together?
-Uh!</b></font>

54
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:39,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Well...
I'd like to if you would.</b></font>

55
00:03:39,890 --> 00:03:41,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] I mean--
-[SATORU] We studying?</b></font>

56
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go to a diner!</b></font>

57
00:03:43,810 --> 00:03:44,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Ayumi gasps]</b></font>

58
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:47,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[screams]</b></font>

59
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:48,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Uka gasps]</b></font>

60
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:50,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

61
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

62
00:03:52,070 --> 00:03:54,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Soda, please!
-Doria for me.</b></font>

63
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:55,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're up.</b></font>

64
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:57,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Nankotsu.
-[UKA] Oh, no.</b></font>

65
00:03:58,660 --> 00:04:00,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't know
Miura was coming, too.</b></font>

66
00:04:01,070 --> 00:04:02,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
I'm gonna grab my drink.</b></font>

67
00:04:02,950 --> 00:04:04,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I'll join you.
-[AYUMI] No way!</b></font>

68
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:06,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Stay put!
-[Uka trembling]</b></font>

69
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

70
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:10,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What should I say?</b></font>

71
00:04:10,710 --> 00:04:12,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on, think!</b></font>

72
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:14,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"This morning
my egg had two yolks!"</b></font>

73
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cringe.</b></font>

74
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:19,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"So, you and Kanno
used to go out."</b></font>

75
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"So...you went
to the same school."</b></font>

76
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:23,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No good.</b></font>

77
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All I can think about
is the two of them together.</b></font>

78
00:04:26,730 --> 00:04:28,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I shouldn't bring it up.</b></font>

79
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't.</b></font>

80
00:04:29,850 --> 00:04:31,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
Got a table for us?</b></font>

81
00:04:31,690 --> 00:04:33,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WAITRESS 5A]
How many in your party?</b></font>

82
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You need your eyes checked?</b></font>

83
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Four of us, thank you.</b></font>

84
00:04:36,740 --> 00:04:37,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WAITRESS 5A]
Party of four.</b></font>

85
00:04:37,990 --> 00:04:39,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right this way.</b></font>

86
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

87
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

88
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:49,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

89
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Isn't that guy Serina's ex?</b></font>

90
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:53,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

91
00:04:55,460 --> 00:04:57,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Ayumi wasn't kidding.</b></font>

92
00:04:57,210 --> 00:04:58,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is awkward.</b></font>

93
00:05:00,550 --> 00:05:02,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aw, look!
Let's sit here!</b></font>

94
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hold on.
-So, is it true, Miura?</b></font>

95
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you actually
go out with Serina?</b></font>

96
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:07,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Talk to us!</b></font>

97
00:05:07,470 --> 00:05:09,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna hear
all about the split!</b></font>

98
00:05:09,730 --> 00:05:12,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGU]
He's ignoring us? What a laugh!</b></font>

99
00:05:12,270 --> 00:05:14,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RINO]
Hey, why don't you tell us?</b></font>

100
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Don't know, don't care.</b></font>

101
00:05:16,110 --> 00:05:18,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA] A little tea
never killed anyone.</b></font>

102
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:20,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Out of the loop
on that one, for real.</b></font>

103
00:05:20,990 --> 00:05:23,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, Serina,
we can change tables.</b></font>

104
00:05:23,410 --> 00:05:25,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
We'll just follow you!</b></font>

105
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:27,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ah?
-Think we should bounce?</b></font>

106
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think
Uka has enough time</b></font>

107
00:05:29,790 --> 00:05:30,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to go somewhere else.</b></font>

108
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:32,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's getting kinda late.</b></font>

109
00:05:32,330 --> 00:05:33,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
Got plans?</b></font>

110
00:05:33,670 --> 00:05:35,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, my curfew's at 5:00.</b></font>

111
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:37,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ALL]
Uh...</b></font>

112
00:05:37,630 --> 00:05:39,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[all laughing]
-You're kidding, that early?</b></font>

113
00:05:39,340 --> 00:05:41,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do your parents
have to put you in bubble wrap</b></font>

114
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:42,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so you don't hurt yourself?</b></font>

115
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:44,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So cute!
-Does baby need her mommy?</b></font>

116
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGU]
C'mon, who is she, anyway?</b></font>

117
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:47,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RINO]
Does she even go to our school?</b></font>

118
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
Loser!</b></font>

119
00:05:48,970 --> 00:05:51,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Lay off her.
-You're with him?</b></font>

120
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:53,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you expect
anyone to believe that?</b></font>

121
00:05:53,150 --> 00:05:56,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was gonna say!
Everyone's laughing at you!</b></font>

122
00:05:56,110 --> 00:05:57,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
Can you even tell?</b></font>

123
00:05:57,270 --> 00:05:58,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RINO]
She's so lame.</b></font>

124
00:05:58,650 --> 00:06:00,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I almost feel bad!</b></font>

125
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:02,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

126
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:08,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Didn't you hear me?
Lay off!</b></font>

127
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

128
00:06:10,540 --> 00:06:11,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's your deal?</b></font>

129
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RINO] [scoffs]
Whatever.</b></font>

130
00:06:15,130 --> 00:06:16,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have it your way.</b></font>

131
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:19,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ooh, that's good!</b></font>

132
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:20,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're tellin' me!</b></font>

133
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They've been pissin'
me off all year long!</b></font>

134
00:06:22,970 --> 00:06:25,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're noisy in class
when I'm trying to work,</b></font>

135
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:27,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and they're always rude
when we go out!</b></font>

136
00:06:27,180 --> 00:06:29,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] They try to play
cute and say, "What a laugh."</b></font>

137
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:30,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, who's laughing now, huh?</b></font>

138
00:06:30,890 --> 00:06:32,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

139
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should go.</b></font>

140
00:06:37,770 --> 00:06:39,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, I'm sorry!</b></font>

141
00:06:40,030 --> 00:06:41,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And thanks!</b></font>

142
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, no.</b></font>

143
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:44,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm the one who's sorry.</b></font>

144
00:06:44,860 --> 00:06:46,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't let what those
dumb jerks said get to you.</b></font>

145
00:06:48,450 --> 00:06:49,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What?</b></font>

146
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:52,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why is she apologizing to me?</b></font>

147
00:06:53,710 --> 00:06:56,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your name's Uka, right?
Let's chat sometime.</b></font>

148
00:06:56,460 --> 00:06:58,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

149
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:01,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[trickling]</b></font>

150
00:07:01,550 --> 00:07:03,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Serina's always
been a real one, huh?</b></font>

151
00:07:03,340 --> 00:07:05,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm-hm.</b></font>

152
00:07:05,090 --> 00:07:06,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Kanno's awesome.</b></font>

153
00:07:07,340 --> 00:07:09,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She stood up for me
without hesitation,</b></font>

154
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:11,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even though we're strangers.</b></font>

155
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like Miura.</b></font>

156
00:07:14,730 --> 00:07:16,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

157
00:07:16,850 --> 00:07:18,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[water splashing]</b></font>

158
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[metal clanking]</b></font>

159
00:07:21,690 --> 00:07:22,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Rino and Megu chuckles]</b></font>

160
00:07:22,940 --> 00:07:24,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
That's payback for yesterday.</b></font>

161
00:07:25,740 --> 00:07:28,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, somethin'
you wanna say to us?</b></font>

162
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:30,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't forget, we were the ones
who were cool enough</b></font>

163
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to let you in our group.</b></font>

164
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:34,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't remember signing up.</b></font>

165
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Is she okay?</b></font>

166
00:07:35,290 --> 00:07:36,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
The way I see it,</b></font>

167
00:07:36,580 --> 00:07:38,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you got a girl
who's actually popular,</b></font>

168
00:07:38,830 --> 00:07:41,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I got three rats
chasing my crumbs.</b></font>

169
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:42,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

170
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:44,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, if that's how it is,
why don't you hang out</b></font>

171
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:46,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with that loser
Ishimori from now on?</b></font>

172
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:48,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[slaps]</b></font>

173
00:07:48,220 --> 00:07:50,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

174
00:07:53,180 --> 00:07:54,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

175
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Uh, what?</b></font>

176
00:07:56,140 --> 00:07:57,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka?</b></font>

177
00:07:58,270 --> 00:07:59,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am okay!
I'm used to it!</b></font>

178
00:08:00,020 --> 00:08:01,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

179
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:03,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All of this started
because of my curfew!</b></font>

180
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:05,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kanno was just
standing up for me!</b></font>

181
00:08:05,150 --> 00:08:06,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you wanna make
fun of me, go ahead!</b></font>

182
00:08:06,990 --> 00:08:09,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MEGU] Chill.
-Please, just unload!</b></font>

183
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:11,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You're scaring them.</b></font>

184
00:08:11,490 --> 00:08:12,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tough luck.</b></font>

185
00:08:12,780 --> 00:08:15,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Looks like you're in trouble
with "that loser Ishimori."</b></font>

186
00:08:15,750 --> 00:08:17,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
"Can you even tell?"</b></font>

187
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:18,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"I almost feel bad."</b></font>

188
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:22,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all sigh]</b></font>

189
00:08:22,090 --> 00:08:24,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[all gasp]
-Okay, let's get outta here.</b></font>

190
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

191
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:27,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
You're dead to me!</b></font>

192
00:08:27,970 --> 00:08:29,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 5D]
Don't be embarrassing.</b></font>

193
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:32,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Call me for help next time.</b></font>

194
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:33,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Serina.</b></font>

195
00:08:33,810 --> 00:08:35,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

196
00:08:35,180 --> 00:08:36,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

197
00:08:38,850 --> 00:08:40,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

198
00:08:42,690 --> 00:08:44,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] Hey,
I was doing fine without you!</b></font>

199
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:46,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kai, slow down!</b></font>

200
00:08:46,650 --> 00:08:48,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Uka, your face all right?</b></font>

201
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:50,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I'm fine!</b></font>

202
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please don't worry about me!</b></font>

203
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:53,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

204
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't ask.</b></font>

205
00:08:56,450 --> 00:08:58,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't.</b></font>

206
00:08:58,330 --> 00:09:00,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's between them
is none of my business.</b></font>

207
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Even I don't know why!</b></font>

208
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:06,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Out of the loop
on that one, for real.</b></font>

209
00:09:09,010 --> 00:09:11,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't make them tell me.</b></font>

210
00:09:11,340 --> 00:09:13,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently...no one can.</b></font>

211
00:09:15,930 --> 00:09:18,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's clear
who should be at his side.</b></font>

212
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

213
00:09:27,110 --> 00:09:28,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

214
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:32,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>GREETER</b></font>

215
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:34,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Good morning, everyone.</b></font>

216
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You need a little
pep in your step!</b></font>

217
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:37,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good morning, everyone!</b></font>

218
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Good morning, or somethin'.</b></font>

219
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:42,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, isn't Miura here yet?</b></font>

220
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I told him what time
he was starting.</b></font>

221
00:09:44,330 --> 00:09:46,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TOMOYA]
Ah, speaking of.</b></font>

222
00:09:46,090 --> 00:09:47,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] A sweater.
-[TOMOYA] Good morning.</b></font>

223
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
That's a new look.</b></font>

224
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look who's late again!</b></font>

225
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:51,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh?
And where'd your hoodie go?</b></font>

226
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:53,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Lay off me.</b></font>

227
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:54,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ABE]
Here, put it on.</b></font>

228
00:09:54,970 --> 00:09:56,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

229
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That looks so wrong on you!</b></font>

230
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:00,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Name anyone
who makes these look good.</b></font>

231
00:10:00,930 --> 00:10:02,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

232
00:10:04,350 --> 00:10:05,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I hope Kanno's all right</b></font>

233
00:10:05,900 --> 00:10:07,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>considering what
happened yesterday.</b></font>

234
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
Hi, Serina.</b></font>

235
00:10:10,990 --> 00:10:12,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

236
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:14,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you finish
the language homework?</b></font>

237
00:10:16,070 --> 00:10:17,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's check each other's later!</b></font>

238
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:18,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

239
00:10:18,790 --> 00:10:20,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-Ah?</b></font>

240
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGU]
Hey, Ishimori!</b></font>

241
00:10:21,370 --> 00:10:22,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry about yesterday!</b></font>

242
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA]
You all good, now?</b></font>

243
00:10:24,210 --> 00:10:25,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RINO]
We're so sorry.</b></font>

244
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We all felt real bad
about that.</b></font>

245
00:10:28,130 --> 00:10:29,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGU]
It went a little far!</b></font>

246
00:10:29,250 --> 00:10:30,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, think about it.</b></font>

247
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:31,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your curfew's nice!</b></font>

248
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:33,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The fact they want you back
at 5:00 just goes to show</b></font>

249
00:10:33,930 --> 00:10:35,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how much your parents
care about you.</b></font>

250
00:10:35,890 --> 00:10:38,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were a little jealous,
and got carried away.</b></font>

251
00:10:38,510 --> 00:10:40,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, anyway, sorry.</b></font>

252
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't do
anything wrong at all.</b></font>

253
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:43,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Oh, thanks.
[MEGU] Ugh, got that over with!</b></font>

254
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:45,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
They're always like this.</b></font>

255
00:10:45,270 --> 00:10:46,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

256
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:49,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] And you still wanna be
friends with them, Serina?</b></font>

257
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:51,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know, they're not all bad.
Promise.</b></font>

258
00:10:52,070 --> 00:10:53,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd rather like them
than hate them,</b></font>

259
00:10:54,070 --> 00:10:55,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I try to make it work.</b></font>

260
00:10:56,030 --> 00:10:57,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Still...I'm so glad</b></font>

261
00:10:57,660 --> 00:11:00,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they gave you an apology
after the way they treated you.</b></font>

262
00:11:00,290 --> 00:11:02,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry you were caught
in the middle of that.</b></font>

263
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's my fault.</b></font>

264
00:11:03,370 --> 00:11:05,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

265
00:11:05,210 --> 00:11:06,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both laughing]</b></font>

266
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:10,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[SERINA] Oh, right. Kai!
-Hm?</b></font>

267
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:11,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] Can I give you
your hoodie back tomorrow?</b></font>

268
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:13,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just whenever you can.</b></font>

269
00:11:13,170 --> 00:11:14,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] I'll make sure
to wash it first.</b></font>

270
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:16,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] All that awkwardness
went away overnight.</b></font>

271
00:11:17,470 --> 00:11:20,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder what'll happen if they
keep getting close like this.</b></font>

272
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:22,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

273
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:24,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

274
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Something wrong, Yuru?</b></font>

275
00:11:26,140 --> 00:11:29,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know, something's been
on my mind for a while now!</b></font>

276
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:31,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] Hm!
I wanna give Uka a ponytail!</b></font>

277
00:11:31,860 --> 00:11:32,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ahh.</b></font>

278
00:11:32,940 --> 00:11:34,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU]
Promise you'll look cute!</b></font>

279
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:38,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
Ta-dah!</b></font>

280
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:40,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Ah!</b></font>

281
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:41,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Everyone, look!
-[SATORU] What the hell?</b></font>

282
00:11:41,990 --> 00:11:44,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why are they freaking out
like they found a dead body?</b></font>

283
00:11:45,210 --> 00:11:47,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] When's the last time
I put up my hair?</b></font>

284
00:11:47,250 --> 00:11:48,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't remember.</b></font>

285
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a little embarrassing.</b></font>

286
00:11:51,250 --> 00:11:52,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is this look okay on me?</b></font>

287
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

288
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Makin' friends like a pro.</b></font>

289
00:11:58,260 --> 00:12:00,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly,
you'd do fine without me.</b></font>

290
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:01,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

291
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:04,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What does he mean by that?</b></font>

292
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:07,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe he doesn't want me
around anymore?</b></font>

293
00:12:07,850 --> 00:12:09,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

294
00:12:11,150 --> 00:12:12,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI] Okay,
pay attention to this one.</b></font>

295
00:12:12,980 --> 00:12:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Excuse me, teach!</b></font>

296
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:16,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do we need
to know for test day?</b></font>

297
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:18,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As long as you've been
taking notes, you'll be fine.</b></font>

298
00:12:18,450 --> 00:12:21,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TONBO] You know I'm not paying
enough attention for that!</b></font>

299
00:12:21,330 --> 00:12:22,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Someone! Save me!</b></font>

300
00:12:22,990 --> 00:12:24,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
There's no saving you.</b></font>

301
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on, don't get mad!</b></font>

302
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:26,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIZOGUCHI]
How would you feel if no one</b></font>

303
00:12:26,870 --> 00:12:27,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>paid attention to you?</b></font>

304
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's fine!</b></font>

305
00:12:29,460 --> 00:12:31,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[bell chiming]</b></font>

306
00:12:32,250 --> 00:12:34,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Let's go to the store.
-Yeah!</b></font>

307
00:12:34,590 --> 00:12:36,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Excuse me!
-Uh?</b></font>

308
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:38,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here!
Copy mine!</b></font>

309
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ah!
-[both groan</b></font>

310
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah, whoops.</b></font>

311
00:12:41,970 --> 00:12:43,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We weren't serious.</b></font>

312
00:12:43,180 --> 00:12:45,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We don't actually care
how we do on the test.</b></font>

313
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>More like we're just
ridin' the vibe</b></font>

314
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:48,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with the teach, ya know?</b></font>

315
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]
"Vibe?"</b></font>

316
00:12:50,310 --> 00:12:51,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Watch it, Tonbo.</b></font>

317
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:54,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't use words
like that around her.</b></font>

318
00:12:54,150 --> 00:12:56,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think Ishimori even
understands what vibes are?</b></font>

319
00:12:56,820 --> 00:12:59,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, hey,
thanks a bunch for the offer!</b></font>

320
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not like we were gonna
study anyway.</b></font>

321
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

322
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:05,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Guess I messed up again.</b></font>

323
00:13:06,700 --> 00:13:08,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll take ya there sometime!</b></font>

324
00:13:08,580 --> 00:13:10,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We could go this weekend,
if you're free.</b></font>

325
00:13:10,170 --> 00:13:11,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

326
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
"Vibe.</b></font>

327
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:16,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A person's emotional state</b></font>

328
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:18,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or the mood of the room."</b></font>

329
00:13:18,170 --> 00:13:19,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

330
00:13:19,970 --> 00:13:21,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I kinda understand,</b></font>

331
00:13:22,010 --> 00:13:23,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I kinda don't.</b></font>

332
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:26,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder if it's wrong
to even look it up.</b></font>

333
00:13:26,470 --> 00:13:28,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like it's something
I'm supposed to just get.</b></font>

334
00:13:29,270 --> 00:13:31,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[all laughing]</b></font>

335
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Something's wrong with me.</b></font>

336
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:38,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAMAKIRI] Don't ya think
Serina's mad hot?</b></font>

337
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:40,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And she always smells so good.</b></font>

338
00:13:40,450 --> 00:13:41,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So?
Spill it.</b></font>

339
00:13:41,990 --> 00:13:44,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why'd you break up?
Tell us!</b></font>

340
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or we can all take guesses,
and see who gets it right.</b></font>

341
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YASUSHI]
Oh! One of 'em cheated!</b></font>

342
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:50,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-They couldn't get along!
-Kai played it too cool!</b></font>

343
00:13:52,290 --> 00:13:53,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There it is!</b></font>

344
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:56,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"I can't really tell
if you care about me!</b></font>

345
00:13:56,210 --> 00:13:58,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You never let me know
what's going on in your head!"</b></font>

346
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:00,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like that?</b></font>

347
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:02,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gotta be!
It's so like Kai!</b></font>

348
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:03,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're way too cold.</b></font>

349
00:14:03,590 --> 00:14:04,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIRU]
Like, dude...</b></font>

350
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:07,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you ever tell a girl you
like her, or you're jealous?</b></font>

351
00:14:07,390 --> 00:14:08,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once or twice.</b></font>

352
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Hm?
-[MIRU] Oh?</b></font>

353
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:11,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

354
00:14:13,850 --> 00:14:15,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Once or twice?</b></font>

355
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

356
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:19,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, sure.</b></font>

357
00:14:21,070 --> 00:14:23,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It must be something
only Kanno gets to see.</b></font>

358
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:25,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A different side to him.</b></font>

359
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just for her.</b></font>

360
00:14:27,830 --> 00:14:29,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A side I'll never witness.</b></font>

361
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:31,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

362
00:14:31,790 --> 00:14:33,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Nap time.
-Hm?</b></font>

363
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:38,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'll wake you up
when the bell rings.</b></font>

364
00:14:38,090 --> 00:14:39,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] [sighs]
Thanks.</b></font>

365
00:14:39,710 --> 00:14:41,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

366
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Is this it?</b></font>

367
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is this how he sees me?</b></font>

368
00:14:50,430 --> 00:14:51,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[clock ticking]</b></font>

369
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:54,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's fine.</b></font>

370
00:14:54,100 --> 00:14:55,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least, it means
I'm useful to him.</b></font>

371
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:59,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tell me...</b></font>

372
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:01,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when you got slapped yesterday,</b></font>

373
00:15:01,570 --> 00:15:04,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you mentioned something
about being "used to it."</b></font>

374
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Were you being literal?</b></font>

375
00:15:06,910 --> 00:15:08,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

376
00:15:08,490 --> 00:15:10,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, no.</b></font>

377
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:12,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd never actually gotten
slapped in the face before.</b></font>

378
00:15:13,370 --> 00:15:14,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] [sighs]
Good.</b></font>

379
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Another mistake.</b></font>

380
00:15:16,210 --> 00:15:17,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I made him worry over nothing.</b></font>

381
00:15:19,290 --> 00:15:20,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

382
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:26,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's swollen.
Must've hurt.</b></font>

383
00:15:26,930 --> 00:15:28,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

384
00:15:30,310 --> 00:15:31,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

385
00:15:31,770 --> 00:15:33,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You're bright red.</b></font>

386
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:36,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, wake me when it's time.</b></font>

387
00:15:38,730 --> 00:15:40,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

388
00:15:40,610 --> 00:15:42,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Whoa!</b></font>

389
00:15:42,610 --> 00:15:44,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where did any
of that come from?</b></font>

390
00:15:44,490 --> 00:15:46,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura's hand was...
Wait!</b></font>

391
00:15:46,610 --> 00:15:48,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, remember,
you have to breathe!</b></font>

392
00:15:48,530 --> 00:15:50,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nope! Freaking out!</b></font>

393
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[deep breathing]</b></font>

394
00:15:53,370 --> 00:15:55,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Sorry, I'll be back.</b></font>

395
00:15:57,170 --> 00:15:59,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footfall]</b></font>

396
00:16:01,500 --> 00:16:03,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door opens and closes]</b></font>

397
00:16:05,050 --> 00:16:07,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Why do I react like this?</b></font>

398
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:08,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I the only one?</b></font>

399
00:16:09,390 --> 00:16:11,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm reading too much into it.</b></font>

400
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:13,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It wasn't a big deal to him.</b></font>

401
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:16,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura lives in a completely
different world from me.</b></font>

402
00:16:16,350 --> 00:16:18,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One with everyone else in it.</b></font>

403
00:16:18,190 --> 00:16:20,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I might never reach.</b></font>

404
00:16:20,610 --> 00:16:22,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGU]
Hey, Ishimori!</b></font>

405
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:24,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-See Kai?
-Uh.</b></font>

406
00:16:24,990 --> 00:16:26,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.</b></font>

407
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:29,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]
Like I thought.</b></font>

408
00:16:29,160 --> 00:16:30,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NOA] We're not
in the same class as him,</b></font>

409
00:16:30,950 --> 00:16:32,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so how are we
supposed to chat</b></font>

410
00:16:32,410 --> 00:16:33,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if he's not around
during breaks?</b></font>

411
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:34,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGU] [sighs]
Bummer.</b></font>

412
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RINO]
Where do ya think he went?</b></font>

413
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it safe to say you know?</b></font>

414
00:16:40,670 --> 00:16:42,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Ah!
-[chuckles]</b></font>

415
00:16:42,170 --> 00:16:44,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I were gonna bet,
then I'd guess the storage room</b></font>

416
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:45,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on the fourth floor!</b></font>

417
00:16:45,550 --> 00:16:46,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, you don't
have to confirm that!</b></font>

418
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:48,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Amazing!
You know him so well!</b></font>

419
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:49,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're right!</b></font>

420
00:16:49,890 --> 00:16:50,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

421
00:16:50,970 --> 00:16:52,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Just goes to show it, though.</b></font>

422
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:54,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one's closer to Miura
than she is.</b></font>

423
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:57,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, he still runs off
to empty rooms</b></font>

424
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:58,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to take his naps, huh?</b></font>

425
00:16:59,060 --> 00:17:01,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Has he always done that?
-Yep.</b></font>

426
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:03,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He would ask me to watch him
sleep on the roof.</b></font>

427
00:17:03,770 --> 00:17:05,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I'm like, how'd he manage
to open the door?</b></font>

428
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:07,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The thing was locked!</b></font>

429
00:17:07,110 --> 00:17:09,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, didn't he say
to keep it a secret, though?</b></font>

430
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think you're
the exception, Kanno.</b></font>

431
00:17:11,950 --> 00:17:13,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What is that supposed to mean?</b></font>

432
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:15,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll just pretend
like you never told me!</b></font>

433
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:17,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Also, don't use "Kanno."</b></font>

434
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just call me Serina!</b></font>

435
00:17:19,330 --> 00:17:20,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

436
00:17:20,620 --> 00:17:21,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

437
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
"Serina."</b></font>

438
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:25,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She is amazing.</b></font>

439
00:17:25,590 --> 00:17:27,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cute and tough.</b></font>

440
00:17:27,590 --> 00:17:29,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And yet...so gentle.</b></font>

441
00:17:30,550 --> 00:17:31,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly?</b></font>

442
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:33,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seeing all this reminds me
of junior high.</b></font>

443
00:17:33,890 --> 00:17:35,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're the same as me!</b></font>

444
00:17:35,390 --> 00:17:37,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We even got the same
"no blabbing" rule.</b></font>

445
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:40,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

446
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:42,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But he never asked me
to join him up there.</b></font>

447
00:17:42,860 --> 00:17:44,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just randomly found out.</b></font>

448
00:17:45,020 --> 00:17:46,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not anything like you.</b></font>

449
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:49,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're too good
to compare yourself to me.</b></font>

450
00:17:49,820 --> 00:17:52,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

451
00:17:52,110 --> 00:17:53,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

452
00:17:56,950 --> 00:17:59,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Oh, I made it
hard for her to respond.</b></font>

453
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She feels bad because of me.</b></font>

454
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:03,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

455
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:05,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a nuisance to others.</b></font>

456
00:18:05,710 --> 00:18:07,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to change that, too.</b></font>

457
00:18:08,130 --> 00:18:09,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But how can I</b></font>

458
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:12,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I'm constantly
putting myself down?</b></font>

459
00:18:12,130 --> 00:18:14,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to embrace my new life.</b></font>

460
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:18,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But how can I,
when I do...this?</b></font>

461
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:19,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[UKA] Um, sorry--
-[MALE STUDENT 5E] Serina!</b></font>

462
00:18:19,810 --> 00:18:22,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, girl.
Care to explain this?</b></font>

463
00:18:22,190 --> 00:18:23,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Excuse me?</b></font>

464
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:26,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why do you have a picture
of your ex on your phone?</b></font>

465
00:18:27,690 --> 00:18:30,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA] More like, why are
you looking without asking?</b></font>

466
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How'd you even
get my phone open?</b></font>

467
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:33,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIHO] Sorry.
Didn't know</b></font>

468
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:35,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they were
looking over my shoulder.</b></font>

469
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:36,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 5F]
Well, speak of the devil,</b></font>

470
00:18:36,950 --> 00:18:38,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and he shall appear!</b></font>

471
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look at what I found!</b></font>

472
00:18:40,580 --> 00:18:42,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Looks like someone wants
to come crawling back to you!</b></font>

473
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:43,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, no!</b></font>

474
00:18:43,870 --> 00:18:45,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should give her
another chance!</b></font>

475
00:18:45,380 --> 00:18:47,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] I've got the same pic
in my phone, you know.</b></font>

476
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:48,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[YURU] We all do.</b></font>

477
00:18:48,840 --> 00:18:50,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] It's supposed
to make you popular.</b></font>

478
00:18:51,010 --> 00:18:52,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE STUDENT 5F]
Who'd spread a rumor like that?</b></font>

479
00:18:53,010 --> 00:18:54,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When we all first
saw the yearbook,</b></font>

480
00:18:54,590 --> 00:18:56,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the girls thought Kai's photo
was way too pretty,</b></font>

481
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:58,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and we wished we could have one
half as good as that.</b></font>

482
00:18:58,970 --> 00:19:01,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, we snapped a pic or two,
'cause, hey.</b></font>

483
00:19:01,100 --> 00:19:02,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe it'll make us
gals prettier!</b></font>

484
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:05,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, so I took the picture and
gave it to the rest of them.</b></font>

485
00:19:06,770 --> 00:19:08,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Here, thanks again.</b></font>

486
00:19:09,230 --> 00:19:10,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, I can just get
a person's qualities</b></font>

487
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:12,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if I keep a picture of them?</b></font>

488
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:14,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In that case,
I want one of Serina!</b></font>

489
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:15,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's gorg.</b></font>

490
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:18,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then, I ought to grab
one of Takamine.</b></font>

491
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ayumi's would work, too.</b></font>

492
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:20,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's cute.</b></font>

493
00:19:20,740 --> 00:19:22,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want more friends,
so I'll take Seto.</b></font>

494
00:19:22,750 --> 00:19:24,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So what's your trait?</b></font>

495
00:19:24,540 --> 00:19:26,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

496
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:27,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIHO]
From your picture?</b></font>

497
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MIHO] Ishimori--
[KAI] Self-doubting.</b></font>

498
00:19:31,170 --> 00:19:32,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's a little harsh.</b></font>

499
00:19:32,710 --> 00:19:34,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Anxious.</b></font>

500
00:19:34,260 --> 00:19:35,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thinks too much.</b></font>

501
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:37,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Martyr.</b></font>

502
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:39,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honest.</b></font>

503
00:19:40,180 --> 00:19:41,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Caring.</b></font>

504
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:44,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[sighs]
-[KAI] Courageous.</b></font>

505
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:46,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

506
00:19:46,350 --> 00:19:48,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now leave.
Get one of Tomoya.</b></font>

507
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:50,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, let's go, Serina.</b></font>

508
00:19:50,770 --> 00:19:51,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Bossy.</b></font>

509
00:19:51,900 --> 00:19:54,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
And, too self-deprecating.</b></font>

510
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:57,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[KAI] Yuru.
-Hm?</b></font>

511
00:19:57,110 --> 00:19:58,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI] Do her hair
like this again sometime.</b></font>

512
00:19:59,070 --> 00:20:01,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That mean she actually
likes it this way?</b></font>

513
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No clue.
I'm saying I like it.</b></font>

514
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:06,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

515
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:08,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

516
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:09,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[yawns]</b></font>

517
00:20:09,670 --> 00:20:11,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Back to sleep.</b></font>

518
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[trembling]</b></font>

519
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:17,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I can't stand.</b></font>

520
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:19,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not after that.</b></font>

521
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:21,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
Honest.</b></font>

522
00:20:22,890 --> 00:20:24,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]
Caring.</b></font>

523
00:20:24,140 --> 00:20:25,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

524
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:27,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Courageous.</b></font>

525
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:28,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I know he's right.</b></font>

526
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:32,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I am courageous...</b></font>

527
00:20:33,230 --> 00:20:34,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because I love him.</b></font>

528
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:11,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'm exactly where I need to be.</b></font>

529
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to do more than study.</b></font>

530
00:22:16,300 --> 00:22:17,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't keep writing things off</b></font>

531
00:22:17,750 --> 00:22:19,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as beyond my depth.</b></font>

532
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:24,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, the midterms
are now safely behind us.</b></font>

533
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:27,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, I hope you're ready
for the culture festival!</b></font>

534
00:22:27,350 --> 00:22:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, let's select someone
as our committee member.</b></font>

535
00:22:29,850 --> 00:22:30,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Any volunteers?</b></font>

536
00:22:31,060 --> 00:22:32,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
Sounds super boring.</b></font>

537
00:22:32,850 --> 00:22:35,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO] How can you ask
without explaining what it is?</b></font>

538
00:22:35,310 --> 00:22:36,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

539
00:22:39,030 --> 00:22:41,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-[UKA] I volunteer.</b></font>

540
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Please, let me!</b></font>

541
00:22:42,740 --> 00:22:44,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'll try anything I can.</b></font>

542
00:22:45,410 --> 00:22:46,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anything new.</b></font>

543
00:22:46,830 --> 00:22:48,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

544
00:22:48,620 --> 00:22:50,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Until that one day...</b></font>

545
00:22:50,660 --> 00:22:52,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when I can finally
be their equal.</b></font>

546
00:22:53,170 --> 00:22:54,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TO BE CONTINUED</b></font>

